# Expected result: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:5221/api/analytics/categories/999/stats

###

# ANALYTICS - OVERVIEW
# Expected result: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:5221/api/analytics/overview

###

# ANALYTICS - PRICE HISTORY
# Expected result: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:5221/api/analytics/listings/1/price-history

###

